[h1]Better Journal UI by Najane[/h1]

Gives the Journal on the left of the screen a permanent background, so your tracked goals stay readable over the map.

[b]No rules change.[/b] Saved games are unaffected and the mod is safe to add or remove mid-game.

[hr][/hr]
[h2]What you get[/h2]
[list]
[*]A gold frame with cut-in corners around the whole Journal, shown all the time - not only when you hover an entry.
[*]No second frame around the hovered entry - just the game's highlight inside the Journal's own frame.
[*]Hidden completely while there are no goals to track, instead of an empty title.
[*]Two looks: the game's own hover gradient, or [b]solid dark navy[/b].
[/list]

[h2]Settings[/h2]
Options → Mods → [i]Najane Mods: journal[/i]
[list]
[*][b]Journal background opacity[/b] - 0 to 100%. 0 turns the background off.
[*][b]Solid background[/b] - switches the gradient to solid dark navy.
[/list]

Languages: English, Polish.
